{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54284","headline":"哀林虔中 · 余镐","name":"哀林虔中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"接翅十年同抗疏，投荒万里独登楼。\n常山忽爲孤城死，睢水空存百战谋。\n函草漫从灰里觅，嘤声长向梦中求。\n欲知後死今何事，已在莆中买钓舟。\n（《闽诗录甲集》卷一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"余镐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}